[[0,3272769,0,1,0,1,"2019-06-12T00:31:34","GodsAngell","[e]",[],"<p><strong>Yelp is MAFIA!!! Extorting Small Businesses for Cash!!! One Small Business Owner Fought Back &amp; WON.....here's how....</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Yelp extortion backfires</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Yelp does indeed remove positive reviews for your business if you don't pay them a hefty extortion fee, and Yelp itself will in turn write negative reviews written by their own staff</strong> even if they never hit your restaurant or business if you do not pay the extortion fee. I stopped paying attention to online reviews back in the 90's because they are predominantly B.S.</p>\n<p><strong>Take a look at what one pizza shop did to Yelp.</strong> </p>\n<p><strong>The restaurant owner who asked for 1-star Yelp reviews</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How one small business owner flipped the online review ecosystem on its head.</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://thehustle.co/botto-bistro-1-star-yelp/\">https://thehustle.co/botto-bistro-1-star-yelp/</a></p>\n<p>Just like my boycott of AMC and Disney for their boycotts of Georgia over Georgia's new abortion laws, <strong>Yelp needs a boycott BADLY, STOP USING YELP,</strong> they are bullshit anyway. Just like Amazon reviews, you really have to read to the bottom on Amazon to know what is going on there. I have a GREAT example of a company posting fake reviews on Amazon, and you'll be surprised what company did it.</p>","Yelp extortion backfires!! Yelp is MAFIA!!! Extorting Small Businesses for Cash!!! One Small Business Owner Fought Back & WON.....here's how....","","GreatAwakening"],[1,19134165,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T00:40:48","PGLiterati","",[],"<p>I can't get to the hustle without subscribing and I've never visited the Hustle. Any other sources on this?</p>"],[2,19134398,19134165,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T00:59:38","PepeFarmRemembers","",[],"<p>You need the Dissenter web browser and UBlock Origin I guess... No issue here with the OP's link...</p>\n<p>It's archived tho: <a href=\"https://archive.fo/6TtJc\">https://archive.fo/6TtJc</a></p>"],[3,19134672,19134398,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T01:17:08","GodsAngell","",[],"<p>Thanks. I didn't know people were having trouble with the link above.</p>"],[3,19137094,19134398,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T04:04:38","PGLiterati","",[],"<p>Thanks for the help. Actually Yelp as an extortion racket seems obvious, now that someone has said something.</p>"],[1,19134613,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T01:10:29","chocolatepatriot2","",[],"<p>hum interesting i was wondering how they made money, now we know its thru extortion.</p>"],[1,19135877,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T02:34:51","MIMI1999","",[],"<p>Never used Yelp but sounds Like we’re being extorted by Twitter, YouTube etc? Deleted comments, vote and follower changes, suspensions for hyped reasons and the list goes on. Voice your conservative view and click, you have no voice. Q followers are the favorite targets. Keep complaining....many loud voices will eventually get changes made with right lawmakers and judges.</p>"],[1,19137027,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T04:01:31","tomdogg","",[],"<p>I use Zomato instead.</p>"],[1,19138210,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T06:07:01","beefartist","",[],"<p>This is old news and has sweet fucking nothing to do with GA. Go back to reddit, cunt</p>"],[2,19148101,19138210,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T20:42:35","GodsAngell","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://voat.co/u/Crensch\">@Crensch</a></p>"],[3,19150698,19148101,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T23:45:26","beefartist","",[],"<p>I suppose you could tattle but as far as I understand everyone here is well aware of your insanity and your refusal to not post drivel. Upon further consideration I retract the rude things I said; I ought not be so hard on someone, I think you honestly have problems and it isn't cool of me to push you further. FWIW I don't think this has anything to do with this sub but I could have downvoated and moved on or asked you to clarify (not usefully I am sure). I don't care about my screen name nor my internet points so please don't think I am trying not to get banned. Please seek help and limit your screen time</p>"],[1,19146162,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T18:37:57","CarefulNow","",[],"<p>Louis Rossmann, independent Apple repair tech and youtuber documented his experiences with them a few years back with occasional updates upto the beginning of this month. It's interesting to hear their tactics. His playlist can be viewed here <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkVbIsAWN2luXUhlA1bO1Ca69zlSMSmie\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkVbIsAWN2luXUhlA1bO1Ca69zlSMSmie</a></p>"]]
