[[0,3272773,0,1,0,1,"2019-06-12T00:33:25","thislionsheart","",[],"","Prime Minister of Poland Signs Global Appeal to Stop 5G","https://www.counterpunch.org/2019/06/11/prime-minister-of-poland-signs-global-appeal-to-stop-5g/","GreatAwakening"],[1,19134287,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T00:50:56","DawnPendraig","",[],"<p>God bless Poland!</p>"],[1,19134641,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T01:13:06","isalod_2298","",[],"<p>If anyone has the chance to visit, Poland is an absolutely beautiful country. I had the pleasure of getting invited to a Polish wedding in a small town, and that trip was a complete eye opener. Every family knows each other, they help raise each other’s kids by keeping an eye out, and they are the kindest hosts. Also had amazing quality dental work done there, and stocked up on good quality products at a fraction of the price. It’s one of the most underrated tourist destinations, in my opinion.</p>"],[2,19136023,19134641,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T02:44:28","K-Harbour","",[],"<p>Dittos.</p>"],[1,19134920,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T01:34:21","Rabid_Robot","",[],"<p>I'm starting to wish my Polish parents had managed through Communism and given birth to me there.</p>"],[1,19135629,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T02:14:48","tradstew","",[],"<p>Is Poland the only country which has any sense left? It certainly beginning to look that way.</p>"],[1,19136010,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T02:43:58","K-Harbour","",[],"<p>Hmmm.... The first country to eliminate land telephone lines. They probably know their technology.</p>"],[1,19137932,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T05:31:15","Novusod","",[],"<p>The Poles are a woke people. After decades of communism they don't want to go back to that hell.</p>"],[1,19139758,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T10:18:34","GracieTracie2","",[],"<p>Why is POTUS pushing for 5G? I’m not a shill or anything. I just don’t comment. I’m a silent observer that has yet figured out why 5G is so important. Defense? Free energy? Weapons? Why the push if it could make us sick? Hopefully I won’t be attacked for asking, I’m just looking for answers.</p>"],[2,19141343,19139758,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T13:15:59","feli00","",[],"<p>Trump is Jewish and mason and satanic and puppet of the Jewish central banking cartel. Talmudism is at war with humanity and 5G is genocidal</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ibb.co/c23QpzP\">https://ibb.co/c23QpzP</a></p>\n<p>Read the entire page</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ibb.co/4mdcykJ\">https://ibb.co/4mdcykJ</a></p>"],[1,19141299,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T13:13:07","feli00","",[],"<p>It is weird because all the countries are controlled by the world secret Jewish criminal government. Stop for example that Rotschild's peon advocates to implement it already. In fact the deep state to which he belongs is installing it in haste in the US</p>"],[1,19142553,0,0,0,0,"2019-06-12T14:49:19","thebearfromstartrack","",[],"<p>We don't NEED this sort of SHIT.</p>"]]
